#: ../../citing.md:1 c31e7e9cdaec4587976f362b644535be
msgid "Citing This Book and DEAPack"
msgstr "如何引用本书与 DEAPack"

#: ../../citing.md:3 9f0df7cfaddc43ff9aafc14a6d996e51
msgid ""
"The book and DEAPack are related but distinct scholarly works. Cite the "
"book when relying on its theory, unified vocabulary, interpretation, or "
"worked cases. Cite the software when reporting a computation, "
"implementation, or numerical workflow. Cite both when both materially "
"support the study."
msgstr ""
"本书与 DEAPack "
"相互关联，但属于两项不同的学术成果。使用本书的理论、统一术语、解释或案例时，应引用本书；报告计算、实现或数值工作流时，应引用软件；二者都对研究构成实质支持时，应同时引用。"

#: ../../citing.md:8 da8947726c424904aabca7f36f1a66bf
msgid "Cite the book"
msgstr "引用本书"

#: ../../citing.md:10 99a9b70aef69458f868d37c49089b368
msgid ""
"The current English-source Handbook and its Chinese translation form "
"*Bilingual Handbook Preview 1*, one development manuscript by Daoping "
"Wang. Until a formal edition supplies its own bibliographic record, "
"identify the repository snapshot and language that you consulted. A "
"suitable citation for the English rendering is:"
msgstr "当前英文源手册及其中文译本共同构成《双语手册预览版 1》（Bilingual Handbook Preview 1），这是 Daoping Wang 编写的一部开发中手稿。在正式版本形成独立书目记录之前，请注明您实际查阅的仓库快照及语言。英文版本可采用如下引用格式："

#: ../../citing.md:16 9e0baabd73034912ba591a069e580960
msgid ""
"Wang, Daoping. *Data Envelopment Analysis: Efficiency, Productivity, and "
"Environmental Performance with Python*. Bilingual Handbook Preview 1, "
"English rendering, development manuscript, DEAPack repository, commit "
"**FULL_COMMIT_HASH**, accessed **YYYY-MM-DD**. "
"<https://github.com/daopingw/DEAPack>"
msgstr ""
"Wang, Daoping. *Data Envelopment Analysis: Efficiency, Productivity, and "
"Environmental Performance with Python*. Bilingual Handbook Preview 1，英文版本，开发中手稿，DEAPack repository，commit "
"**FULL_COMMIT_HASH**，访问日期 **YYYY-MM-"
"DD**。<https://github.com/daopingw/DEAPack>"

#: ../../citing.md:22 651cf272d5b541629dc3294b1d45019a
msgid ""
"Replace the bold placeholders with the full Git commit hash and your "
"access date. Do not add a publisher, publication year, edition number, or"
" persistent identifier that the cited snapshot does not carry."
msgstr "请用完整 Git commit hash 和访问日期替换粗体占位符。不要为所引用快照擅自添加其并不具有的出版社、出版年份、版次或永久标识符。"

#: ../../citing.md:26 62f5d7b8686e48e2aa8c5abe132e6be4
msgid ""
"For the Chinese rendering, retain the author and English title so that "
"the record remains discoverable, add “Chinese translation” in brackets, "
"and use the same commit and access date. The two renderings should not be"
" assigned separate placeholder DOI or ISBN values."
msgstr "引用中文版本时，为便于检索，请保留作者姓名和英文书名，在方括号中注明“Chinese translation”，并使用相同的 commit hash 和访问日期。不得为两种语言版本分别虚构 DOI 或 ISBN。"

#: ../../citing.md:31 67010447476c47d4a6b6dbad637d118b
msgid "Cite the software"
msgstr "引用软件"

#: ../../citing.md:33 a9facf489e984d0098f6c2f98b2120cd
msgid ""
"The repository's current software citation metadata are recorded in "
"[CITATION.cff](https://github.com/daopingw/DEAPack/blob/main/CITATION.cff)."
" Use those metadata for the software citation and report the exact "
"DEAPack version used in the analysis. The installed version is available "
"in Python:"
msgstr ""
"仓库当前的软件引用元数据记录在 "
"[CITATION.cff](https://github.com/daopingw/DEAPack/blob/main/CITATION.cff)"
" 中。请使用这些元数据引用软件，并报告分析所用的确切 DEAPack 版本。可以在 Python 中查看已安装版本："

#: ../../citing.md:44 86ffce73351341c396b0d9283a5217cb
msgid ""
"For an unreleased or source-based analysis, also record the full "
"repository commit:"
msgstr "对于尚未发布或直接基于源代码的分析，还应记录完整的仓库 commit："

#: ../../citing.md:51 3f5d567c13644335a00c10302c336389
msgid ""
"The version, commit when applicable, data snapshot, and analysis code "
"together identify the computation more precisely than the package name "
"alone."
msgstr "版本、适用时的 commit、数据快照和分析代码结合起来，比单独的包名更准确地标识一项计算。"
